* PMOS Transistor
M1 6 3 1 1 PMOS

* Voltage Sources
VGG 7 5 DC VGG
VDD 2 0 DC VDD

* Resistor
RD 6 vO RD

* Connections
* Net 1 is connected to Source of PMOS
* Net 3 is connected to Gate of PMOS
* Net 6 is connected to Drain of PMOS and one end of RD
* vO is the output
* Ground is represented by net 5
.END